      "observed": "U1 (ATtiny45-20P) and U2 (ATtiny13V-10S) are wired in parallel on the same nets. On U2 the schematic shows PB3 on pin 3 tied to NET0009 and PB4 on pin 2 tied to NET0010, matching the ATtiny45 pin assignment shown for U1.",
      "expected": "For an ATtiny13, the physical pinout is pin 2 = PB3 and pin 3 = PB4. If U2 is intended as an alternative ATtiny13 footprint, NET0009 and NET0010 must be swapped for U2, or U2 must not be connected in parallel with the ATtiny45 pinout.",
